    xkos:plainText "* bread and bread rolls_x000D_\n* crispbreads, rusks, toasted bread and crackers_x000D_\n* tortillas_x000D_\n* injera_x000D_\n* pizza bases without topping, whether precooked or not_x000D_\n* gingerbread and the like_x000D_\n* sweet biscuits (cookies)_x000D_\n* waffles and wafers_x000D_\n* ice cream cones_x000D_\n* crumpets, muffins, croissants, sweet tarts, sweet pies, and other pastry goods and cakes"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.1.3/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
