<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.2.1/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Live land animals, both domestic and wild, for human consumption as food."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.2.1/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* cattle (cows; calves; common ox, zebu or humped ox; watusi, gaur, gayal, banteng and yak)_x000D_\n* buffaloes (Indian or water buffaloes; arnis, or Asiatic buffaloes; Celebes anoas, or pygmy buffaloes; African buffaloes, such as the dwarf buffalo and the large Caffrarian buffalo; American bisons, known simply as buffaloes; European bisons; and beefaloes (hybrid offspring of American bisons and domestic cattle)_x000D_\n* pigs_x000D_\n* goats, lambs and sheep_x000D_\n* poultry (chickens, ducks, geese, turkeys and guinea fowl)_x000D_\n* hares and rabbits_x000D_\n* horses, donkeys and other equines_x000D_\n* camels, dromedaries, alpaca, llamas, guanacos, vicuñas and other camelids_x000D_\n* ostriches, emus, rheas, pheasants, grouse, pigeons, quails and other birds_x000D_\n* snakes and other reptiles_x000D_\n* spiders, scorpions, insects and worms_x000D_\n* terrestrial snails_x000D_\n* frogs"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.2.1/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* live fish (01.1.3.1)_x000D_\n* other live seafood (01.1.3.4)_x000D_\n* live animals for transport (07.1.4.0)_x000D_\n* live animals purchased for recreational purposes (09.1.2.4)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.2.2> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "01.1.2.2" ;
