<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.7.9/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Preparations of vegetables, tubers, salep, plantains, cooking bananas and pulses, whether frozen or not."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.7.9/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* flours of vegetables, pulses, tubers, plantains and cooking bananas_x000D_\n* canned vegetables_x000D_\n* preserved olives, vegetable flakes, vegetable purées and vegetable chips and crisps_x000D_\n* chipped potatoes, frozen_x000D_\n* vegetable concentrates_x000D_\n* homogenized preparations_x000D_\n* vegetable pickles"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.7.9/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* soy meat and soy burgers, veggie burgers, tofu, tempeh and other meat substitutes made from vegetables and nuts_x000D_\n* kocho (a flatbread made from the starch obtained from the fermentation of the green leaf sheaths green leaf sheaths of the enset plant)_x000D_\n* potato starch, tapioca, sago and other starches"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.7.9/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* seitan and other meat substitutes made from cereals (01.1.1.9)_x000D_\n* ready-made vegetable preparations, whether frozen or not, including other ingredients, such as cheese, meat or fish; and ready-made soups (01.1.9.1)_x000D_\n* homogenized baby food preparations (01.1.9.2)_x000D_\n* culinary herbs and spices (01.1.9.4)_x000D_\n* broths and stocks containing vegetables (01.1.9.9)_x000D_\n* vegetable juices (01.2.1.0)"@en .

