    xkos:plainText "* cereal grinding services for flour production_x000D_\n* oil pressing services_x000D_\n* crushing and pressing services for the production of juices made from fruits and vegetables_x000D_\n* custom slaughtering of land animals, both domestic and wild, for food purposes"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.3.0.0/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
