    xkos:plainText "Includes:_x000D_\n* cigars_x000D_\n* cigars that are purchased in bars and restaurants, provided that a service charge is not applied"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/02.3.0.9> a skos:Concept ;
