    xkos:plainText "* pipe tobacco, chewing tobacco, hookah blends, snus and snuff_x000D_\n* cigarette tobacco and tobacco leaf_x000D_\n* cigarette papers and single-use filters which are consumed with the cigarette_x000D_\n* refills for electronic cigarettes, with or without nicotine_x000D_\n* tobacco that is consumed with a shisha or a hookah pipe if consumed at home"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/02.3.0.9/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* tobacco that is consumed through use of a shisha or a hookah pipe in restaurants, cafés or shisha lounges (11.1.1)_x000D_\n* electronic cigarette devices (13.2.9.1) and other articles for smokers"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/02.4> a skos:Concept ;
