    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/03.2.1.3/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/03.2.1.3/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* all footwear for infants and children (under 13 years of age) either ready-to-wear or made to measure"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/03.2.1.3/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* gaiters and similar articles_x000D_\n* shoelaces_x000D_\n* parts of footwear, such as heels, soles, etc., purchased by households with the intention of repairing footwear themselves_x000D_\n* sports footwear suitable for everyday or leisure wear (shoes for jogging cross-training, tennis, basketball, boating, etc.)_x000D_\n* baby’s booties made of fabric or sheepskin"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/03.2.1.3/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* cleaning, repair and hire of footwear (03.2.2.0)_x000D_\n* polishes, creams and other shoe-cleaning articles (05.6.1.1)_x000D_\n* therapeutic footwear (06.1.3.3)_x000D_\n* game-specific footwear (ski boots, football boots, golfing shoes and other such footwear fitted with ice skates, rollers, spikes, studs, etc.); and shin guards, cricket pads and other such protective sports apparel (09.2.2.1)"@en .

