<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/03.2.2.0/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "The cost of materials is included only if they are not separately priced."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/03.2.2.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* repair of footwear_x000D_\n* shoe-cleaning services_x000D_\n* dyeing of shoes_x000D_\n* hire of footwear"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/03.2.2.0/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* parts of footwear, such as heels, soles, etc., purchased by households with the intention of undertaking footwear repair themselves (03.2.1)_x000D_\n* polishes, creams and other shoe-cleaning articles (05.6.1.1)_x000D_\n* hire and repair of game-specific footwear (ski boots, football boots, golfing shoes and other such footwear fitted with ice skates, rollers, spikes, studs, etc.) (09.4.4.0)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "04" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Housing, water, electricity, gas and other fuels"@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04/note/coreContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Division 04 covers goods and services related to the maintenance, repair and security of the dwelling as well as water supply, energy supply for heating and cooling, and other dwelling-related services. _x000D_\n_x000D_\nActual and imputed rentals for main and secondary residences, which are treated in accordance with the practice of the 2008 System of National Accounts are classified to groups 04.1 and 04.2, respectively._x000D_\n_x000D_\nDwelling maintenance, repair and security includes, under group 04.3, materials purchased by tenants and owner-occupiers with the intention of undertaking maintenance and repair themselves, as well as the services for the maintenance, repair and security of the dwelling purchased from enterprises. It should be noted that only expenditures on materials and services intended for minor maintenance and repairs are covered under group 04.3:  expenditures on materials and services for major maintenance and repair – which are usually the responsibility of a landlord rather than of tenants – are not considered part of individual consumption expenditures of households and are thus out of scope of the classification."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "04.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Actual rental payments made for housing"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1/note/coreContentNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Rentals normally include payment for the use of the land on which the property stands; the dwelling occupied; the fixtures and fittings for heating, plumbing, lighting and so on; and, in the case of a dwelling that is let furnished, the furniture._x000D_\n_x000D_\nRentals also include payment for the use of a garage that provides parking in connection with the dwelling. However, the garage does not need to be physically contiguous to the dwelling nor does it have to be leased from the same landlord._x000D_\n_x000D_\nRentals do not include payment for the use of a garage or parking space that provides parking not in connection with the dwelling (07.2.4). Nor do they include charges for water supply (04.4.1), refuse collection (04.4.2) or sewage collection (04.4.3); co-proprietor charges for caretaking, gardening, stairwell cleaning, heating and lighting, maintenance of lifts and refuse disposal chutes and so on, in multi-occupied buildings (04.4.4); charges for electricity (04.5.1) and gas (04.5.2); or charges for heating and hot water (04.5.3, 04.5.4) supplied by district heating plants (04.5.5)._x000D_\n_x000D_\nEvery household has a principal dwelling (sometimes designated as the main or primary home), which is usually determined on the basis of the amount of time spent there whose location defines the country of residence and place of usual residence of the household and all of its members. All other homes owned or leased by the household are considered secondary dwellings."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* rentals actually paid by tenants or subtenants occupying furnished or unfurnished premises as their main residence"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* payments by households occupying a room in a hotel or boarding house as their main residence"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* accommodation services of boarding schools, universities and other educational establishments (11.2.0.3)_x000D_\n* accommodation services of hostels for workers (11.2.0.9)_x000D_\n* retirement homes for elderly persons (13.3.0.2)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "04.1.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Actual rental payments made by tenants for main residence (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* rentals actually paid by tenants or subtenants occupying furnished or unfurnished premises as their main residence"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* payments by households occupying a room in a hotel or boarding house as their main residence"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* rentals paid for use of a garage that provides parking and storage in connection with a dwelling (04.1.2.2)_x000D_\n* accommodation services of boarding schools, universities and other educational establishments (11.2.0.3)_x000D_\n* accommodation services of hostels for workers (11.2.0.9)_x000D_\n* retirement homes for elderly persons (13.3.0.2)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1.0> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "04.1.1.0" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Actual rental payments made by tenants for main residence (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1.0/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1.0/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1.0/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* rentals actually paid by tenants or subtenants occupying furnished or unfurnished premises as their main residence"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1.0/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* payments by households occupying a room in a hotel or boarding house as their main residence"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.1.0/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* rental paid for use of a garage that provides parking and storage but not in connection with a dwelling (04.1.2.2)_x000D_\n* accommodation services of boarding schools, universities and other educational establishments (11.2.0.3)_x000D_\n* accommodation services of hostels for workers (11.2.0.9)_x000D_\n* retirement homes for elderly persons (13.3.0.2)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "04.1.2" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Other actual rental payments (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* rentals actually paid for secondary residences_x000D_\n* rentals of self-storage units_x000D_\n* garage rentals"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* accommodation services of holiday villages and holiday centres (11.2.0.2)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "04.1.2.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Actual rental payments made by tenants for secondary residences (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.1/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.1/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.1/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* rentals actually paid for secondary residences"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.1/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* accommodation services of holiday villages and holiday centres (11.2.0.2)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.2> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "04.1.2.2" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Garage rental payments and other rental payments made by tenants (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.2/note/coreContentNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.2/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.2/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.2/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Rental payments for the use of a garage that provides parking and/or storage in connection with a dwelling. The garage or storage facility does not have to be physically contiguous to the dwelling, nor does it have to be leased from the same landlord."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.2/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* garage rentals in connection with the dwelling_x000D_\n* rentals of self-storage units"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.1.2.2/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* payment for the use of a parking space or a garage that provides parking but not in connection with a dwelling (07.2.4.1)_x000D_\n* removal and storage services (07.4.9.1)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.2> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "04.2" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Imputed rental payments for housing"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.2/note/coreContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/04.2/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Persons who own the dwellings in which they live are treated as the owners of unincorporated enterprises producing housing services that are consumed by the household of which the owner is a member. The housing services produced are deemed to be equal in value to the rentals that would be paid on the market for accommodation of the same size, quality and type; and the imputed values of those services are recorded as final consumption expenditures of the owners. _x000D_\n_x000D_\nImputed rentals normally include values for the use of the land on which the property stands, the dwelling occupied, and the fixtures and fittings for heating, plumbing, lighting and so on. Imputed rentals also include payment for the use of a garage that provides parking in connection with the dwelling but does not have to be physically contiguous to the dwelling._x000D_\n_x000D_\nImputed rentals do not include payment for the use of garages or parking spaces that provide parking not in connection with the dwelling (07.2.4). Nor do they include charges for water supply (04.4.1), refuse collection (04.4.2) or sewage collection (04.4.3); co-proprietor charges for caretaking, gardening, stairwell cleaning, heating and lighting, maintenance of lifts and refuse disposal chutes, etc. in multi-occupied buildings (04.4.4); charges for electricity (04.5.1) and gas (04.5.2); or charges for heating and hot water (04.5.3, 04.5.4) supplied by district heating plants (04.5.5)."@en .

