<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "05" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Furnishings, household equipment and routine household maintenance"@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05/note/coreContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Division 05 covers the wide range of products and equipment – durable, semi-durable and non-durable – used to furnish a house or dwelling, as well as the associated household services. This division includes all types of furniture, furnishings and lighting equipment (05.1); household textiles (05.2); major and small electric household appliances (05.3); glassware, tableware and household utensils (05.4); tools and equipment for house and garden (05.5); and goods used for routine household maintenance (05.6.1)._x000D_\n_x000D_\nAlso included are repair, installation and rental of the goods classified to division 05._x000D_\n_x000D_\nDomestic services by paid staff in private service, supplied by enterprises and self-employed persons, are included, as well as window cleaning; pest extermination; disinfection; and dry-cleaning, laundering and dyeing of household textiles and carpets (05.6.2)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "05.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Furniture, furnishings, and loose carpets"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.1.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "05.1.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Furniture, furnishings and loose carpets (D)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.1> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.1.1/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.1.1/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.1.1/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.1.1/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* sofas, couches, tables, chairs, cupboards, chests of drawers and bookshelves, hanger stands and coat stands_x000D_\n* bunk beds and baby furniture, such as cradles, highchairs and playpens_x000D_\n* beds, mattresses, mattress bases (tatamis), wardrobes and bedside tables_x000D_\n* kitchen tables, chairs, cupboards and surfaces_x000D_\n* furniture primarily for bathroom use_x000D_\n* furniture primarily for garden use_x000D_\n* wrought iron benches, tables and arbours_x000D_\n* small garden sheds for the storage of garden tools and machines_x000D_\n* camping furniture_x000D_\n* lighting equipment, such as ceiling lights, standard lamps, globe lights, bedside lamps, and light and LED strings"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.1.1/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* inflatable sofas, armchairs and beds_x000D_\n* custom-made furniture_x000D_\n* loose carpets and rugs_x000D_\n* pictures, sculptures, engravings, tapestries, other art objects, including reproductions of works of art, and other ornaments_x000D_\n* statuettes and other decorative articles, including those made of porcelain and crystal glass_x000D_\n* wall clocks, floor clocks, alarm clocks and travel clocks_x000D_\n* screens, folding partitions, non-textile blinds, mirrors, candle holders and candlesticks_x000D_\n* leather and fur for upholstery and room decoration"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.1.1/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* decorative garden materials (09.3.1.1)_x000D_\n* repair and hire of household, garden and camping furniture and lighting equipment (05.1.2.0)_x000D_\n* installation of furniture and furnishings if separately priced from delivery (05.1.2.0)_x000D_\n* bedding (bed linen) (05.2.1.2)_x000D_\n* sunshades (05.2.1.9)_x000D_\n* safes (05.3.1.9)_x000D_\n* ornamental glass and ceramic articles (05.4.0.1)_x000D_\n* light bulbs, tubes and LEDs (05.5.2.2)_x000D_\n* delivery of loose carpets and other furniture and furnishings if separately priced (07.4.9.2)_x000D_\n* installation of furniture and furnishings if not separately priced from delivery (07.4.9.2)_x000D_\n* light strings for Christmas trees (09.2.1.3)_x000D_\n* camping equipment (09.2.2.2)_x000D_\n* carrycots, pushchairs/strollers; and wall thermometers and barometers (13.2.9.1)_x000D_\n* works of art and antique furniture acquired primarily as stores of value (capital formation)"@en .

