<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6.2> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "05.6.2" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Domestic services and household services (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6.2/note/coreContentNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6.2/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6.2/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6.2/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6.2/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Domestic services (05.6.2.1) include services provided by personnel employed by households (such as butlers, maids, cooks, nannies, governesses, cleaners, au pairs and gardeners), as well as similar household services such as babysitting, gardening and cleaning supplied by enterprises and self-employed persons. Other household services (05.6.2.9) are non-routine domestic services typically provided by enterprises and self-employed persons, such as carpet cleaning, pest extermination and disinfection."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6.2/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* domestic services provided by paid staff employed by the household, such as butlers, cooks, maids, drivers, gardeners, governesses, au pairs and nannies_x000D_\n* similar services, including babysitting and housework, provided by enterprises and self-employed persons_x000D_\n* window cleaning, disinfection, fumigation and pest extermination_x000D_\n* dry-cleaning, laundering and dyeing of household linen, household textiles and carpets_x000D_\n* shampooing of carpets_x000D_\n* taking care of a dwelling in the absence of the owner, whether or not occupying the dwelling; house-sitting"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6.2/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* ironing of household clothes and linen by housemaids in the family residence"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6.2/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* dry-cleaning, laundering and dyeing of garments (03.1.4.1)_x000D_\n* security services (04.3.2.0)_x000D_\n* refuse collection (04.4.2.0)_x000D_\n* sewage collection (04.4.3)_x000D_\n* co-proprietor charges for caretaking, gardening, stairwell cleaning, heating and lighting, maintenance of lifts and refuse disposal chutes and so on, in multi-occupied buildings (04.4.4.1)_x000D_\n* snow removal and chimney sweeping (04.4.4.9)_x000D_\n* removal and storage services (07.4.9.1)_x000D_\n* child-minding with an educational component (10.1.0.1)_x000D_\n* child-minding outside the home (13.3.0.1)_x000D_\n* bodyguards (13.9.0.9)"@en .

