    xkos:plainText "* domestic services provided by paid staff employed by the household, such as butlers, cooks, maids, drivers, gardeners, governesses, au pairs and nannies_x000D_\n* 	similar domestic services including babysitting, gardening and cleaning supplied by enterprises and self-employed persons"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/05.6.2.1/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* ironing of household clothes and linen by housemaids in the family residence"@en .

