<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/08> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "08" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Information and communication"@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/08/note/coreContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/08/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Division 08 covers three main groups of goods and services: information and communication equipment, including equipment for the reception, recording and reproduction of sound and vision (08.1); software (08.2); and information and communication services (08.3). Information and communication services include telephone services, services providing Internet access, television and radio licences and fees, and subscription services, including streaming services of film and music._x000D_\n_x000D_\nDivision 08 also includes repair, maintenance and rental of all information and communication equipment."@en .

