<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/09.2.1.2/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* traditional games, for example, card games, parlour games, board games, chess sets_x000D_\n* dolls_x000D_\n* toy cars, including toy trains, toy bicycles and tricycles_x000D_\n* remote controlled toy cars, ships, planes and aerial vehicles_x000D_\n* soft toys, teddy bears and so on_x000D_\n* toy construction sets_x000D_\n* toy instruments_x000D_\n* puzzles_x000D_\n* modelling clay_x000D_\n* masks_x000D_\n* disguises_x000D_\n* joke toys_x000D_\n* novelties_x000D_\n* models and replicas of planes, boats, trains and so on_x000D_\n* requisites for stamp-collecting practised as a hobby (used or cancelled postage stamps, stamp albums, etc.)_x000D_\n* other collection items (coins, medals, minerals, zoological and botanical specimens, etc.) and other hobby tools and articles, n.e.c."@en .

