    xkos:plainText "* game-specific footwear (ski boots, football boots, golfing shoes and other such footwear fitted with ice skates, rollers, spikes, studs, etc.)_x000D_\n* game-specific sportswear (ski suits, etc.)_x000D_\n* protective sports headgear_x000D_\n* other protective sports gear, such as life jackets, boxing gloves, sport gloves, body padding, shin guards, goggles, belts, supports"@en .

