<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Education services"@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10/note/coreContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Division 10 covers educational services only. The focus of groups 10.1 to 10.4 is on formal education (that leads to a certificate or diploma). It includes education done through radio or television broadcasting and e-learning and correspondence courses. It also includes admission and registration fees, as well as tuition fees. It further includes other education-related fees, such as camps and field trips, course fees, diploma fees, examination fees, graduation fees, laboratory fees, and physical education fees._x000D_\n_x000D_\nThe breakdown of educational services is based on the level categories of the 2011 revision of the International Standard Classification of Education (ISCED 2011) of UNESCO._x000D_\n_x000D_\nThis division does not include expenditures on other education-related goods and services, such as:_x000D_\n* school uniforms (03.1.2.4)_x000D_\n* education support services, such as health-care services (06)_x000D_\n* transport services, except in the case of excursions that are part of the normal school programme (07.3.2.3)_x000D_\n* textbooks and academic journals (09.7.1.1)_x000D_\n* stationery (09.7.4.0)_x000D_\n* catering services (11.1.2.1)_x000D_\n* accommodation services (11.2.0.3)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Early childhood and primary education"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.1.0" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Early childhood and primary education (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* levels 0 and 1 of ISCED 2011 (early childhood and primary education)_x000D_\n* literacy programmes for students too old for primary school_x000D_\n* education services for children with special educational need"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* excursions that are part of the normal school programme (travel and accommodation costs)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* childcare services without educational programme (13.3.0.1)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.1.0.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Early childhood education (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0.1/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0.1/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0.1/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0.1/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* level 0 of ISCED 2011: Early childhood education is designed primarily to support children’s early cognitive, physical, social and emotional development and introduce very young children to organized instruction outside the family context. Programmes are designed for children below the entry age to primary education and are typically centre- or school-based. This education may also be provided in hospitals or in special schools or training centres_x000D_\n* education services for children with special educational needs"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0.1/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* excursions that are part of the normal school programme (travel and accommodation costs)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0.1/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* childcare services without educational programme (13.3.0.1)."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0.2> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.1.0.2" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Primary education (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0.2/note/inclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.1.0.2/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* level 1 of ISCED 2011: Primary education usually begins at age 5, 6 or 7 and generally lasts for four to seven years. Programmes are normally designed to provide students with fundamental skills in reading, writing and mathematics and to establish a solid foundation for learning and understanding core areas of knowledge and personal and social development_x000D_\n* organized instruction for children with special needs and literacy or basic skills programmes within or outside the school system that are similar in content to programmes in primary education_x000D_\n* literacy programmes for students too old for primary school_x000D_\n* excursions that are part of the normal school programme (travel and accommodation costs)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.2" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Secondary education"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.2.0" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Secondary education (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0/note/additionalContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* levels 2 and 3 of ISCED 2011 (lower-secondary and upper secondary education). Secondary education is designed to lay the foundation for lifelong learning and human development and to provide the skills and knowledge needed either for further studies at post-secondary and tertiary levels or for entry into the labour market, or both. Programmes are increasingly subject-oriented and specialized. Different study options or streams are offered, including vocational education and training_x000D_\n* secondary education for adults and young people, including second chance or reintegration programmes_x000D_\n* out-of-school secondary education for adults and young people_x000D_\n* education services for adolescents with special educational needs"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* excursions or student exchanges that are part of the normal school programme (travel and accommodation costs)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0.0> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.2.0.0" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Secondary education (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0.0/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0.0/note/additionalContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* levels 2 and 3 of ISCED 2011 (lower-secondary and upper secondary education). Secondary education is designed to lay the foundation for lifelong learning and human development and to provide the skills and knowledge needed either for further studies at post-secondary and tertiary levels or for entry into the labour market, or both. Programmes are increasingly subject-oriented and specialized. Different study options or streams are offered, including vocational education and training_x000D_\n* secondary education for adults and young people, including second chance or reintegration programmes_x000D_\n* out-of-school secondary education for adults and young people_x000D_\n* education services for adolescents with special educational needs"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.2.0.0/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* excursions or student exchanges that are part of the normal school programme (travel and accommodation costs)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.3" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Post-secondary non-tertiary education"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.3.0" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Post-secondary non-tertiary education (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0/note/additionalContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* level 4 of ISCED 2011 (post-secondary non-tertiary education) provides learning experiences building on secondary education, preparing for entry into the labour market and tertiary education. It is aimed at the individual acquisition of knowledge, skills and competencies lower than the level of complexity characteristic of tertiary education. Post-secondary non-tertiary education is typically designed to provide individuals who completed upper secondary education without qualifications required for progression to tertiary education and/or for individuals seeking specific types of employment when their secondary qualification does not grant such access. For example, graduates from general secondary programmes may choose to complete a non-tertiary vocational qualification or graduates from vocational secondary programmes may choose to increase their level of qualifications or specialize further. Usually, programmes at this level are designed for direct entry into the labour market. General programmes designed to give access to or improved access to tertiary education can also exist_x000D_\n* out-of-school post-secondary non-tertiary education for adults and young people_x000D_\n* education services for young people and adults with special educational needs"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* excursions or student exchanges that are part of the normal school programme (travel and accommodation costs)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0.0> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.3.0.0" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Post-secondary non-tertiary education (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0.0/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0.0/note/additionalContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* level 4 of ISCED 2011 (post-secondary non-tertiary education) provides learning experiences building on secondary education, preparing for entry into the labour market and tertiary education. It is aimed at the individual acquisition of knowledge, skills and competencies lower than the level of complexity characteristic of tertiary education. Post-secondary non-tertiary education is typically designed to provide individuals who completed upper secondary education without qualifications required for progression to tertiary education and/or for individuals seeking specific types of employment when their secondary qualification does not grant such access. For example, graduates from general secondary programmes may choose to complete a non-tertiary vocational qualification or graduates from vocational secondary programmes may choose to increase their level of qualifications or specialize further. Usually, programmes at this level are designed for direct entry into the labour market. General programmes designed to give access to or improved access to tertiary education can also exist_x000D_\n* out-of-school post-secondary non-tertiary education for adults and young people_x000D_\n* education services for young people and adults with special educational needs"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.3.0.0/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* excursions or student exchanges that are part of the normal school programme (travel and accommodation costs)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.4" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Tertiary education"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.4.0" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Tertiary education (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0/note/additionalContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* levels 5, 6, 7 and 8 of ISCED 2011 (tertiary education) build on secondary education and provide learning activities in specialized fields of education. It is aimed at a high level of complexity and specialization. It includes both academic education and advanced vocational or professional education. At the highest levels, programmes lead to an advanced research qualification based on advanced study and original research"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* excursions or student exchanges that are part of the normal school programme (travel and accommodation costs)_x000D_\n* university admission tests"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0.0> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.4.0.0" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Tertiary education (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0.0/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0.0/note/additionalContentNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* levels 5, 6, 7 and 8 of ISCED 2011 (tertiary education) build on secondary education and provide learning activities in specialized fields of education. It is aimed at a high level of complexity and specialization. They include both academic education and advanced vocational or professional education. At the highest levels, programmes lead to an advanced research qualification based on advanced study and original research"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.4.0.0/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* excursions or student exchanges that are part of the normal school programme (travel and accommodation costs)_x000D_\n* university admission tests"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.5" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Education not defined by level"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.5.0" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Education not defined by level (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* independent tutors (private lessons), tutor centres, homework help centres and so on_x000D_\n* short educational courses, generally for adults, which do not require any special prior instruction, in particular cultural development or some types of vocational training_x000D_\n* language immersion courses and international travel for learning languages_x000D_\n* languages courses in classroom or online_x000D_\n* language proficiency tests_x000D_\n* courses in the use of computers and/or specific software_x000D_\n* exam preparation courses_x000D_\n* online tutoring"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* driving lessons (07.2.4.3)_x000D_\n* training courses for recreation and sports that are not part of an educational programme (09.4.6)_x000D_\n* removable media containing foreign language trainers (09.7.1.1)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.5.0.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Tutoring (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0.1/note/inclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0.1/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* independent tutors (private lessons to support formal education), tutor centres, homework help centres and so on_x000D_\n* exam preparation courses_x000D_\n* online tutoring"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0.9> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "10.5.0.9" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Other education not defined by level (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0.9/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0.9/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0.9/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* short educational courses, generally for adults, which do not require any special prior instruction, in particular cultural development or some types of vocational training_x000D_\n* language immersion courses and international travel for learning languages_x000D_\n* languages courses in classroom or online_x000D_\n* language proficiency tests_x000D_\n* courses in the use of computers and/or specific software"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/10.5.0.9/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* driving lessons (07.2.4.3)_x000D_\n* training courses for recreation and sports that are not part of an educational programme (09.4.6)_x000D_\n* removable media containing foreign language trainers (09.7.1.1)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "11" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Restaurants and accommodation services"@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11/note/coreContentNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Division 11 covers food and beverage serving services provided by restaurants, cafés and similar facilities, either with full, limited or self-service, or by canteens, cafeterias or refectories at work or school and other educational establishment premises (11.1). The distinction between full service and limited service relates to the range of the food and beverage serving services: a service by waiters to the individual customer seated at tables will be qualified as a full service._x000D_\n_x000D_\nAccommodation (11.2) includes services for visitors and other travellers away from their principal or secondary residence. If not separately priced, it also includes food and beverage services and other serving services, such as housekeeping, parking, laundry, swimming pools and exercise rooms, recreational facilities and conference and convention facilities."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* permanent principal or secondary residence accommodation (division 04)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "11.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Food and beverage serving services"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "11.1.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Restaurants, cafés and the like (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1/note/coreContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Food and beverages services provided by restaurants, cafés and similar eating facilities providing full, limited or self-service."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* tobacco that is consumed with a shisha or a hookah pipe in restaurants, cafés or shisha lounges_x000D_\n* tips and gratuities"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* food and beverage provided by supermarkets and markets whether or not consumed on their premises (division 01 or division 02)_x000D_\n* food products and beverages dispensed by automatic vending machines not in connection with a self-service restaurant or similar (e.g., automat restaurants) (01.1.9.1 or 02.1)_x000D_\n* tobacco purchases (02.3.0)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services on public transport, if not separately priced (07.3)_x000D_\n* food and beverage delivery services, if separately priced (07.4.9.2)_x000D_\n* dancing establishment and nightclub entrance fees (09.4.6.1)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services in establishments providing recreational, cultural, sporting or entertainment services, if not separately priced (09.4.6, 09.6.1.0, 09.6.2.0, 09.6.9.0)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services provided in package holidays, if not separately priced (09.8.0.0)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services provided by hotels or other lodging establishments, if not separately priced from accommodation (11.2)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1.1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "11.1.1.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Restaurants, cafés and the like – with full service (S)"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1> ;
    xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1.1/note/coreContentNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1.1/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1.1/note/exclusionNote> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1.1/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Food and beverage serving services provided by restaurants, cafés and similar eating facilities providing full service consisting of waiter service to individual customers seated at tables, with or without entertainment."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1.1/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* food and beverages provided by full-service facilities serving mainly drinks: cafés, buffets, bars, tearooms and so on_x000D_\n* food and beverages provided by full-service restaurants, cafés and the like and consumed off their premises; food and beverages provided by full-service restaurants, cafés and the like and home-delivered_x000D_\n* food and beverage full services in hotels or other accommodation establishments, if separately priced from accommodation_x000D_\n* food and beverage full services in establishments providing recreational, cultural, sporting or entertainment services (theatres, cinemas, sports stadiums, swimming pools, sports complexes, museums, art galleries, nightclubs, dancing establishments and similar facilities), if separately priced_x000D_\n* tobacco that is consumed with a shisha or a hookah pipe in restaurants, cafés or shisha lounges_x000D_\n* tips and gratuities"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1.1/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* food and beverage provided by supermarkets and markets whether or not consumed on their premises (division 01 or division 02)_x000D_\n* tobacco purchases (02.3.0)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services on public transport, if not separately priced (07.3)_x000D_\n* food and beverage delivery, if separately priced (07.4.9.2)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services in establishments providing recreational, cultural, sporting or entertainment services, if not separately priced (09.4.6, 09.6.1.0, 09.6.2.0, 09.6.9.0)_x000D_\n* entrance fees for dancing establishments and nightclubs (09.4.6.1)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services provided in package holidays, if not separately priced (09.8.0.0)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services in hotels or other lodging establishments, if not separately priced from accommodation (11.2)"@en .

