    xkos:plainText "* food and beverage services provided by self-service restaurants_x000D_\n* food and beverages provided by refreshment stands, fish and chip stands, fast-food outlets without seating and take-away facilities_x000D_\n* food products and beverages prepared on the premises and dispensed through automatic vending machines as a delivery service in a self-service restaurant or similar (e.g., automat restaurants)_x000D_\n* food and beverage for immediate consumption provided by kiosks, food stalls, food carts, street vendors and the like"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1.2/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* ice-cream parlours and cake-serving places_x000D_\n* food and beverages provided by catering contractors, whether collected by the customer or delivered to the customer’s home_x000D_\n* food and beverage services on public transport (coaches, trains, boats, aeroplanes, etc.), if separately priced_x000D_\n* tobacco that is consumed with a shisha or a hookah pipe in restaurants, cafés or shisha lounges_x000D_\n* tips and gratuities"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.1.1.2/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* food and beverage provided by supermarkets and markets whether or not consumed on their premises (division 01 or division 02)_x000D_\n* food products and beverages dispensed by automatic vending machines not in connection with a self-service restaurant or similar (e.g., automat restaurants) (01.1.9.1 or 02.1)_x000D_\n* tobacco purchases (02.3.0)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services on public transport, if not separately priced (07.3)_x000D_\n* food and beverage delivery, if separately priced (07.4.9.2)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services in establishments providing recreational, cultural, sporting or entertainment services, if not separately priced (09.4.6, 09.6.1.0, 09.6.2.0, 09.6.9.0)_x000D_\n* entrance fees for dancing establishments and nightclubs (09.4.6.1)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services provided in package holidays, if not separately priced (09.8.0.0)_x000D_\n* food and beverage services in hotels or other lodging establishments, if not separately priced from accommodation (11.2)"@en .

