<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.2.0/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Accommodation services for visitors and other travellers away from their permanent principal or secondary residence. Included here are other services, if not separately priced, such as food and beverage services, housekeeping, parking, laundry, swimming pools and exercise rooms, recreational facilities and conference and convention facilities."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/11.2.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* resorts, hotels, hotels letting rooms by the hour, motels, inns and pensions_x000D_\n* accommodation services provided by private, holiday homes, guesthouses and boarding houses as secondary residence and other “bed and breakfast” establishments_x000D_\n* timeshare units_x000D_\n* holiday villages and holiday centres, camping, onsite (non-mobile) caravans and boats_x000D_\n* youth hostels and mountain refuges_x000D_\n* bungalows, chalets, housekeeping cottages and cabins_x000D_\n* student residences, school and other educational establishment dormitories, when separately priced, hostels and other accommodations for workers_x000D_\n* railway sleeping cars and other public transport, when separately priced_x000D_\n* website fees to list, find and rent lodging_x000D_\n* travel agency fees for accommodation, if priced separately_x000D_\n* tips and gratuities for bellmen, bellhops, hotel porters and maids"@en .

