    xkos:plainText "* travel goods and other carriers of personal effects: suitcases, trunks, travel bags, attaché cases, satchels, handbags, wallets, purses, backpacks for school and travel and so on_x000D_\n* articles for babies:  diapers (nappies) of any material, baby carriages, pushchairs/strollers, carrycots, recliners, back carriers, front carriers, harnesses for babies and so on_x000D_\n* articles for smokers: pipes, lighters, cigarette cases, cigar cutters, ashtrays, electronic cigarette devices and so on_x000D_\n* miscellaneous personal articles: non-corrective sunglasses, protective glasses, umbrellas and parasols, fans, key rings, pill organizers, ear plugs and so on_x000D_\n* funerary articles: coffins, gravestones, urns, burial shrouds, and so on_x000D_\n* lighter fuel; wall thermometers and barometers_x000D_\n* repair and hire of other personal effects"@en .

