<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/13.9.0/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* fees for legal services, employment agencies and so on_x000D_\n* services of lawyers, notaries, accountants and so on_x000D_\n* services of undertakers and other funeral services_x000D_\n* services of estate agents, housing agents, auctioneers, salesroom operators and other intermediaries_x000D_\n* photocopies and other reproductions of documents_x000D_\n* fees for the issue of birth, marriage and death certificates and other administrative documents_x000D_\n* expenditures for religious services (e.g., requiems, baptizing and marriage services)_x000D_\n* expenditures for non-religious services and events, such as coming-of-age celebrations in Latin-American “quince” or debutante balls_x000D_\n* newspaper notices and advertisements_x000D_\n* services of graphologists, astrologers, palmists, private detectives, bodyguards, dating services, matrimonial agencies and marriage guidance counsellors, public writers, miscellaneous concessions (seats, toilets and cloakrooms) and so on_x000D_\n* services provided by prostitutes, sex workers and the like_x000D_\n* firearm licences"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/13.9.0/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* food or beverages consumed in brothels, if separately priced (11.1.1)"@en .

