    xkos:plainText "* meat of seals, walruses, whales and other marine mammals_x000D_\n* meat of antelopes, deer, boars and kangaroos_x000D_\n* meat of ostriches, emus, rheas, pheasant, grouse, pigeons, quails and other birds_x000D_\n* meat of snakes, alligators and other reptiles_x000D_\n* spiders, scorpions, insects and worms_x000D_\n* terrestrial snails_x000D_\n* frogs, dried, salted or smoked"@en .

