<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.7.9.9/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* vegetable flakes, vegetable purée, vegetable chips and crisps, vegetable concentrates;_x000D_\n* homogenized preparations based on vegetables, pulses and tubers_x000D_\n* vegetable pickles_x000D_\n* veggie burgers and other meat substitutes made from vegetables and nuts (excluding soy)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.7.9.9/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* ready-made hummus, baba ghanoush and similar preparations_x000D_\n* kocho (a flatbread made from the starch obtained from the fermentation of the green leaf sheaths green leaf sheaths of the enset plant)_x000D_\n* potato starch, tapioca, sago and other starches"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.7.9.9/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* ready-made vegetables, prepared, frozen or not, including other ingredients, such as cheese or meat/fish; ready-made soups (01.1.9.1.3)_x000D_\n* homogenized preparations as baby food (01.1.9.2.3)_x000D_\n* culinary herbs and spices (01.1.9.4.0)_x000D_\n* broths and stocks containing vegetables (01.1.9.9.0)_x000D_\n* vegetable juices (01.2.1.0.0)"@en .

