<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.9.1.1/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Dishes can include vegetables, meat, fish, cheese, sauces or other ingredients, provided that these are not the main ingredients."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/coicop2018/01.1.9.1.1/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "* precooked dishes in which the prevailing ingredient is pasta (whether stuffed or not);_x000D_\n* precooked dishes in which the prevailing ingredient is rice, quinoa or other cereals;_x000D_\n* couscous dishes;_x000D_\n* ready-to-eat dumplings, ravioli and noodles."@en .

